---

This product also includes OpenTelemetry eBPF Instrumentation (OBI,
go.opentelemetry.io/obi), from https://github.com/open-telemetry/
opentelemetry-ebpf-instrumentation, Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. OBI is vendored in full at
version v0.12.2 under third_party/obi (see LICENSE and NOTICE in that
directory) and referenced via a go.mod replace directive; its own upstream
per-file copyright headers are retained unchanged.

Two local modifications, each marked "LOCAL PATCH (triage-agent)" at the
point of change, are carried on top of that vendored version:

  - third_party/obi/pkg/export/connector/prommgr.go: hands the Prometheus
    mux to an embedding caller instead of opening its own listener when one
    is registered.
  - third_party/obi/pkg/export/connector/prommgr.go: binds OBI's standalone
    metrics listener to loopback only, rather than the upstream wildcard
    bind, when it does run unembedded.
